      "Updates Linear issues through documented GraphQL mutations.",
      "Adds comments to issues using Linear comment creation workflows.",
      "Queries the current user, team states, and project status.",
      "Explains Linear priority numbers and state types for consistent updates.",
      "Uses Linear environment variables for authenticated API requests."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "Requires a valid Linear API key and team ID in the environment.",
