        "title": "Update Issue Status",
        "scenario": "Routine issue maintenance",
        "prompt": "Update Linear issue [identifier] to [state]. Add a short note explaining the reason for the status change."
      },
      {
        "title": "Check Project Progress",
        "scenario": "Project reporting",
        "prompt": "Get the current status for Linear project [project name or ID]. Summarize progress, open work, and completed work."
      },
      {
        "title": "Triage Multiple Findings",
        "scenario": "Advanced issue workflow",
        "prompt": "Review these findings and create or update Linear issues as needed: [findings]. Group duplicates, set priorities, and report every action."
      }
    ],
